Bind Npc 14431 Zone 2
Quest 458 "[Repeatable Solo] Lamia Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Beth has commissioned you to hunt Lamia. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 2001, 2051 at direction_513

Requires player level >= 50 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1250000 experience or 1900000 with premium

direction_513 = location "Lamia" about "Lamia\nMust feed on fresh human blood; attacks all warriors in its vicinity" found "El Morad" at 610 1079 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, Laiva Village is recruiting knights due to heightened monster attacks. I think you should go talk to [Sentinel] Beth."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Nice to meet you. I am Beth, in charge of village security. I've heard so much about you. Meeting you in person like this finally affords hope to our village."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The monster attacks have jumped markedly and the resulting damage dire. At this rate, it's just a matter of time till our village disappears. Please save our village."

On in_progress
    Say "Hope the village will regain peace soon..."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_513

On ready
    Say "Thank you. It seems the road to knighthood is extremely demanding."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you very much. I'm so glad we have a knight like you in our village."
